6.4 Cash rebates are awarded only for “eligible retail spend” made on the Card.  
The following will not be taken into account in the award and computation of cash rebates or 
in the computation of “eligible retail spend”:  
 Annual card fees, interest, late payment charges;  
 Tax payments;  
 Bill payments made via Internet Banking and any AXS Network;

